        }
      ],
      "note": "'Give it to me quick' ends the scene; that the hair was cut and paid for is learned from P28, P30",
      "basis": "implied"
    },
    {
      "id": "e06",
      "when": {
        "seq": 6,
        "after": [
          "e05"
        ],
        "gap": "PT2H",
        "duration": "PT2H"
      },
      "kind": "act",
      "place": "stores",
      "text": "Della spent two hours ransacking the stores for a present for Jim.",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "della",
          "role": "agent"
        }
      ],
      "src": [
        "P18"
      ],
      "mode": "summarised"
    },
    {
      "id": "e07",
      "when": {
        "seq": 7
      },
      "kind": "exchange",
      "place": "stores",
      "text": "Della found the platinum fob chain, paid twenty-one dollars for it and hurried home with 87 cents.",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "della",
          "role": "agent"
        },
        {
          "id": "clerks",
          "role": "agent"
        }
      ],
      "src": [
        "P19"
      ],
      "things": [
        "chain"
      ],
      "importance": 4,
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "transfer",
          "thing": "chain",
          "from": "clerks",
          "to": "della"
        },
        {
          "kind": "adjust",
          "of": "della",
          "what": "cash",
          "by": -2100,
          "unit": "cent"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "e08",
      "when": {
        "seq": 8,
        "after": [
          "e07"
        ],
        "duration": "PT40M"
      },
      "kind": "act",
      "place": "flat",
      "text": "Della repaired the ravages with her curling irons for forty minutes until her head was covered with tiny close-lying curls.",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "della",
          "role": "agent"
        }
      ],
      "src": [
        "P20",
        "P21"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "e09",
      "when": {
        "seq": 9
      },
      "kind": "thought",
      "place": "flat",
      "text": "Della told herself Jim would say she looked like a Coney Island chorus girl, and asked what she could have done with $1.87.",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "della",
          "role": "experiencer"
        }
      ],
      "src": [
        "P22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "e10",
      "when": {
        "seq": 10,
        "at": "--12-24T19:00",
        "precision": "hour"
      },
      "kind": "state",
      "place": "flat",
      "text": "At seven the coffee was made and the pan was ready for the chops.",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "della",
          "role": "agent"
        }
      ],
      "src": [
        "P23"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "e11",
      "when": {
        "seq": 11
      },
      "kind": "speech",
      "place": "flat",
      "text": "Della doubled the chain in her hand and sat on the table by the door; hearing Jim's step she turned white and prayed 'Please God, make him think I am still pretty.'",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "della",
          "role": "speaker"
        }
      ],
      "src": [
        "P24"
      ],
      "says": "Please God, make him think I am still pretty."
    },
    {
      "id": "e12",
      "when": {
        "seq": 12
      },
      "kind": "arrive",
      "place": "flat",
      "text": "Jim entered and closed the door, thin and serious, without gloves or a new overcoat.",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "jim",
          "role": "agent"
        },
        {
          "id": "della",
          "role": "witness"
        }
      ],
      "src": [
        "P25"
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "move",
          "of": "jim",
          "to": "flat"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "e13",
      "when": {
        "seq": 13
      },
      "kind": "perceive",
      "place": "flat",
      "text": "Jim stopped inside the door and stared at Della with an expression she could not read; it terrified her.",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "jim",
          "role": "agent"
        },
        {
          "id": "della",
          "role": "experiencer"
        }
      ],
      "src": [
        "P26"
      ],
      "importance": 5,
      "note": "the cause of the stare is explained at P36"
    },
    {
      "id": "e14",
      "when": {
        "seq": 14
      },
      "kind": "speech",
      "place": "flat",
      "text": "Della went to him and said she had cut off and sold her hair because she could not live through Christmas without giving him a present.",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "della",
          "role": "speaker"
        },
        {
          "id": "jim",
          "role": "addressee"
        }
      ],
      "src": [
        "P27",
        "P28"
      ],
      "says": "Don't look at me that way; I had my hair cut off and sold it because I couldn't have lived through Christmas without giving you a present. It will grow out again. Say Merry Christmas and let's be happy; you don't know what a beautiful, nice gift I've got for you."
    },
    {
      "id": "e15",
      "when": {
        "seq": 15
      },
      "kind": "speech",
      "place": "flat",
      "text": "Jim asked, as if dazed, whether she had cut off her hair and whether it was gone; Della said it was sold and gone.",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "jim",
          "role": "speaker"
        },
        {
          "id": "della",
          "role": "speaker"
        }
      ],
      "src": [
        "P29",
        "P30",
        "P31",
        "P32",
        "P33"
      ],
      "causes": [
        {
          "event": "e14",
          "status": "stated"
        }
      ],
      "says": "(Jim) You've cut off your hair? You say your hair is gone? (Della) Cut off and sold, and gone; don't you like me just as well? Be good to me, it went for you; nobody could ever count my love for you. Shall I put the chops on?"
    },
    {
      "id": "e16",
      "when": {
        "seq": 16,
        "duration": "PT10S"
      },
      "kind": "act",
      "place": "flat",
      "text": "Jim woke from his trance and embraced Della.",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "jim",
          "role": "agent"
        },
        {
          "id": "della",
          "role": "experiencer"
        }
      ],
      "src": [
        "P34"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "e17",
      "when": {
        "seq": 17
      },
      "kind": "speech",
      "place": "flat",
      "text": "Jim threw a package on the table and told her no haircut could make him like her less, but that unwrapping it would show why he had stared.",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "jim",
          "role": "speaker"
        },
        {
          "id": "della",
          "role": "addressee"
        }
      ],
      "src": [
        "P35",
        "P36"
      ],
      "things": [
        "combs"
      ],
      "explains": [
        "e13"
      ],
      "causes": [
        {
          "event": "e-w2",
          "status": "stated"
        }
      ],
      "says": "Don't make any mistake about me; nothing about a haircut could make me like my girl any less. But unwrap that package and you may see why you had me going a while at first."
    },
    {
      "id": "e18",
      "when": {
        "seq": 18
      },
      "kind": "feeling",
      "place": "flat",
      "text": "Della unwrapped the combs: a scream of joy, then hysterical tears; Jim comforted her.",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "della",
          "role": "experiencer"
        },
        {
          "id": "jim",
          "role": "agent"
        }
      ],
      "src": [
        "P37",
        "P38"
      ],
      "things": [
        "combs"
      ],
      "importance": 5,
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "transfer",
          "thing": "combs",
          "from": "jim",
          "to": "della"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "e19",
      "when": {
        "seq": 19
      },
      "kind": "speech",
      "place": "flat",
      "text": "Della hugged the combs and said 'My hair grows so fast, Jim!'",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "della",
          "role": "speaker"
        }
      ],
      "src": [
        "P39"
      ],
      "says": "My hair grows so fast, Jim!"
    },
    {
      "id": "e20",
      "when": {
        "seq": 20
      },
      "kind": "act",
      "place": "flat",
      "text": "Della leapt up and held out the chain, asking for Jim's watch to see how it looked.",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "della",
          "role": "agent"
        },
        {
          "id": "jim",
          "role": "addressee"
        }
      ],
      "src": [
        "P40",
        "P41",
        "P42"
      ],
      "things": [
        "chain"
      ],
      "says": "Isn't it a dandy? I hunted all over town to find it. You'll have to look at the time a hundred times a day now. Give me your watch; I want to see how it looks on it."
    },
    {
      "id": "e21",
      "when": {
        "seq": 21
      },
      "kind": "speech",
      "place": "flat",
      "text": "Jim sat on the couch, smiling, and said he had sold the watch to buy her combs.",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "jim",
          "role": "speaker"
        },
        {
          "id": "della",
          "role": "addressee"
        }
      ],
      "src": [
        "P43",
        "P44"
      ],
      "importance": 5,
      "says": "Let's put our Christmas presents away and keep them a while; they're too nice to use just at present. I sold the watch to get the money to buy your combs. And now suppose you put the chops on."
    },
